y used for monitoring situations in both public and private spaces. It is commonly recognized as a security camera system designed to oversee activities around buildings or areas, often mounted on poles or walls. CCTV systems are particularly prevalent in various settings, including ATM rooms, where they are installed to monitor user activities and ensure the safety of both users and the machines, as well as to prevent criminal acts.\n\nIn addition to their use in ATMs, CCTV systems are also employed in mini markets, where they are connected to monitors in payment areas to enhance security. Furthermore, CCTV cameras play a crucial role in traffic monitoring, recording incidents for evidence in cases of violations or crimes. While CCTV provides significant security benefits, it also raises potential privacy concerns, as it continuously captures footage in both public and private environments. Overall, CCTV serves as an essential tool for surveillance and security, contributing to the safety of various locations and activities.", "POKÉMON:Pokémon is a Japanese media franchise managed by The Pokémon Company, encompassing a wide range of content including video games, anime, and merchandise. The franchise has garnered a substantial global fanbase, appealing to various age groups, regardless of whether individuals engage with the games or watch the anime.", "NINTENDO:Nintendo is a video game company that co-founded The Pokémon Company and is known for its popular gaming consoles and franchises.", "GAME FREAK:Game Freak is a video game developer that co-founded The Pokémon Company and is known for developing the Pokémon video games.", "CREATURES:Creatures is a company that co-founded The Pokémon Company and is involved in the development of Pokémon-related products.", "POKÉMON GO:Pokémon GO is a mobile game that combines augmented reality and GPS technology, enabling players to catch Pokémon in real-world locations. It has gained significant popularity due to its innovative gameplay that encourages exploration and interaction with the environment.", "POKÉMON CENTER:Pokémon Center is an official retail store that specializes in selling Pokémon merchandise. However, it is important to note that this store is not available in Indonesia.", "INDOMARET:Indomaret is a prominent retail chain in Indonesia known for its collaboration with Pokémon Asia. This partnership has led to the creation and sale of official Pokémon merchandise, making it accessible to fans and customers throughout Indonesia.", "POKÉMON ASIA:Pokémon Asia is the regional branch responsible for Pokémon merchandise and collaborations in Asia, including Indonesia.", "CITRA:Citra is an emulator that allows users to play Nintendo games on PC or laptop.", "YUZU:Yuzu is another emulator that enables the playing of Nintendo games on PC or laptop.", "GALIH MASYKUR ADITAMA:Galih Masykur Aditama is a student engaged in exploring and writing about technology and software as they relate to living and life. His work reflects a keen interest in how these fields intersect with everyday experiences and practical applications.", "ANIME:Anime refers to a style of animation that has evolved over the years, improving in graphics quality from older styles to newer ones.", "DIGITAL SINGLE-LENS REFLEX CAMERA:A digital single-lens reflex camera (DSLR) is a type of digital camera that combines traditional camera mechanics with digital imaging technology, favored by both professional and amateur photographers."], "parameters": {"model": "text-embedding-3-small", "temperature": 0.0, "frequency_penalty": null, "presence_penalty": null, "top_p": 1.0, "max_tokens": 4000, "n": 1}, "history": null}